=== 定频率定张力 测量波长与质量
已知
$
  Delta m & = 1 "mg" \
  Delta L & = 0.5 "mm" \
  Delta f & = 0.001 "Hz" ​​ \
   rho_标 & = 1.31 times 10^(-4) "kg/m" ​​
$
所以
$
  u_A (L) & = sqrt(1/(n(n-1)) sum_(i=1)^n (L_i - overline(L))^2) = 0.12 "cm" \
  u_B (L) & = (Delta L) / sqrt(3) = 0.29 "mm" \
     u(L) & = sqrt(u_A(L)^2 + u_B(L)^2) = 0.12 "cm" \
     u(m) & = (Delta m) / sqrt(3) = 0.58 "mg" \
     u(f) & = (Delta f) / sqrt(3) = 0.00058 "Hz" ​​ \
$
由误差传递公式可得：
$
  u(rho)/rho_1 & = sqrt((u(m)/m)^2 + ((2 u(f))/f)^2 + ((2 u(L))/overline(L))^2) = 0.006 \
        u(rho) & = 0.006 times ​1.22 times 10^(-4) = 7 times 10^(-7) "kg/m" ​​ \
           rho & = (1.220 ± 0.007) times 10^(-4) "kg/m" ​​ \
$
相对误差
$
  E_1 = (|rho_1 - rho_标|)/rho_标 times 100% = 6.87% ​​
$

